<title>BRAZIL: Brazil to resurrect alcohol car with &quot;green fleet&quot;.</title>
<headline>Brazil to resurrect alcohol car with &quot;green fleet&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brazilian government will announce a package of measures this week to stimulate the domestic alcohol sector, including creating a &quot;green fleet&quot; of cars for official use, daily newspaper O Globo said.</p>
<p>Brazilian President Fernando Henrique Cardoso was due to announce the plan Monday at the United Nations Earth Summit in New York, which will review attempts for concerted worldwide action on the environment.</p>
